{"parse": {"title": "谋杀始于清晨-06", "pageid": 110540, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-04\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">谋杀始于清晨-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-07\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">谋杀始于清晨</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.B2.E9.94.8B.EF.BC.81.E5.86.B2.E9.94.8B.EF.BC.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"冲锋！冲锋！\">冲锋！冲锋！</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 冲锋！冲锋！</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Charge! Charge!</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官：</div><div>冲锋——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自天空俯瞰，在火炮的掩护下，士兵倾巢而出，如黑色的湍流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嗬……嗬……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵大口喘着气，向着高地机械地奔跑，眼前晃动不清，哪怕她生有一双石像鬼的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河流两岸的秀丽风景已不复最初的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她还记得战前曾和艾格尼丝在沿河的小径上漫步，那时候步履轻快，心情舒畅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摔倒在泥泞的弹坑里，看不出颜色的军服上又裹上一层泥沙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>咳咳……咳咳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湿土散发出的浓烈腥臭与铁锈味用力捂住了她的口鼻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰冷的雨水让她的大脑刺痛起来，她艰难地爬起身，继续前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又有什么绊了她一下，她低下头，是一条软绵绵的手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>西蒙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的战友了无生息地躺倒在地，他死于己方掩护的炮火下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不要让你的同胞独自作战！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘学家，你们的能力会扭转战局！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跨越种族的藩篱，为神圣的祖国而战！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>——骗子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>在重机枪和野战炮面前，神秘术只是孩童孱弱的拳脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>人类和神秘学家，都会长眠在无人区，化作枯骨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>占星者逃避不了死亡，炼金术治愈不了坏疽，石化者对抗不了轰炸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她跟随其他战友从铁丝网的缺口涌入战壕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来不及看清对方的脸，看到敌军制服的瞬间，她抬起手里的枪——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>该死！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>扳机扣下，什么也没有发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>躲过射来的子弹，她熟练地连同衣服一道石化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抛下被泥沙堵住而失去效力的步枪，猛地朝射击者扑了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">敌军士兵：</div><div>咳——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜血从对方的嘴里溅出，染红了玛丽安娜石化的脸庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血肉之躯无法与岩石的硬度相提并论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>枪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她慌忙地从对方身上扯下毛瑟枪，一枚徽章随之落在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这是什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一双交叠的手，似托举又似遮掩，漆黑的表面隐约显出一种诡异的神圣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽，你会去参军吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>必须得去，祖国危在旦夕，况且要是不去，我们的店面也会被炮火摧毁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但我相信战争很快就会结束的，等我回来了，再继续我们的设计！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">——骗子。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>只有对战争一无所知的人，才会提前妄想战争的胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>神啊，这就是你给予我狂妄无知的惩罚吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愣神间，若干黑点落入战壕，相比其他炮弹的狂暴性格，它可称得上“温柔”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但却比任何东西都更令士兵闻风丧胆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官：</div><div>毒气！毒气！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官：</div><div>他妈的这是陷阱，快戴上防毒面具！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>淡黄色的雾气无声地扩散开来。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机枪声塞满了战场。玛丽安娜费力地从壕沟边缘爬出去，接着，是人的身体接连倒下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拖着自己，用尽力气在子弹间躲避狂奔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾气笼罩的边缘，一棵被炸得只剩半截的枯树救了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>泰蕾兹……卡特琳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>勒让……托马斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的胸膛激烈地起伏，浑身颤抖，不自觉地喃喃着战友名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今天之后，她再也听不到这些人的声音了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……天主……请不要抛弃我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜，既然你选择了参军，就应改掉之前的陋习，学会诚心向神祷告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祂不仅能给予你信念与力量，更能赦免你因杀戮犯下的罪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">——骗子。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我对祖国的深爱毋庸置疑，我也不再轻视祷告……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>可为什么罪恶始终攀附着我，为什么恐惧不愿离开我的内心？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的肩胛与小腿像是被什么东西猛地撞了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她不敢停下自己的步伐，求生的本能为她麻痹了所有知觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嗬……嗬……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跨过弹坑，绕过战士的尸体，来时的景象狼狈地在她身后倒退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……马上就安全了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战壕的边缘逐渐向她靠近——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>强烈的冲击将她掀飞，然而祷告也许真的起了作用。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她幸运地滚进战壕，重重摔在壕沟里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>哈……哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她埋在泥下，如一座废弃石像，浑身布满细小的裂纹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她爬起来，贴紧战壕岩壁，缩紧身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敌军反击的炮火没有给他们喘息的空间，像是算好了他们的步伐，重重地落他们头上，地动山摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手开始在脑海里肆意搅弄，牵扯心脏跳出胸膛，她眼前发黑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们，敌人躲藏在山脊，以为可以阻挡我们的意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他们忘了，你们是福兰的胜利者！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今天，我们将在这里结束他们的盘踞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四十八小时内，我们将撕开敌人的防线，终结战争！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:155%\">——骗子！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久，无情的炮击终于结束，幸存的士兵们瘫坐在壕沟里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜终于得以将脸抬了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>硝烟味、血腥气与发霉干草的味道残留在鼻尖，肺像被拉坏的风箱，难以呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>咳咳……咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喉咙火辣麻痒，让她呛咳不已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同样窸窸窣窣的咳嗽，混杂着疲惫的叹息从四处传来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽，撒谎的舌头与流无辜人血的手，都是神所憎恶的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神所喜悦的乃是正直诚实的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>艾格尼丝，你拥有所有天主喜悦的美德，是名副其实的教徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>尽管我已许久没有收到你的来信，但想着你，我还没有失去在煎熬中生存的动力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我偶尔会庆幸，你不必见我所见的。因为这战场上满是无辜的人血和——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:155%\">谎言</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "谋杀始于清晨-06"}}